&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7027379&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609985790&quot; alt=&quot;Keyest&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7027379)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/keyest&quot;  &gt;Keyest&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;：生存即繁衍，我即番茄汤。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chroiridium&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6213424&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609985790&quot; alt=&quot;ChroIridium&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6213424)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chroiridium&quot;  &gt;ChroIridium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;：不由感慨自己是个什么样的贵物。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;回复：&lt;/strong&gt;前辈不要乱说💦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/franz-ismal&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6351354&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609985790&quot; alt=&quot;Franz Ismal&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6351354)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/franz-ismal&quot;  &gt;Franz Ismal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;：键鱼前辈真的好厉害……发文的速度还是质量啥的咱都望尘莫及……哎呀呀，嫉妒心，旺盛起来了！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;回复：&lt;/strong&gt;硼砂禁止！我不是前辈💦&lt;/p&gt;
