					<![CDATA[
						 <div class="main-content"><span class="heading"><span>SCPs</span></span><span class="heading"><span>Tales</span></span><span class="heading"><span>GoI Formats</span></span><span class="heading"><span>Others</span></span><span class="heading"><span>CSS Themes</span></span><span class="heading"><span>Translations</span></span><span class="heading"><span>Agent Doll</span></span> <div style="text-align: center; color: #999"> <p>イヤフォンの向こうで，<br /> 耳机另一边，</p> <p>歌う声に焦がれている，<br /> 传出的歌声让我向往，</p> <p>劣等感 厭世的な気分で朝を待って，<br /> 抱着自卑感与厌世情绪等待着晨光。</p> <p>こんな思いを知っても，<br /> 即使我清楚这样的念头，</p> <p>鼓膜の上であなたが，<br /> 但正因你在我的鼓膜上，</p> <p>クソみたいな現実を，<br /> 把这垃圾的现实，</p> <p>一瞬光らせるから 超越した，<br /> 照亮了一瞬 因此我已然置之度外。</p> </div> <p style="text-align: center;"><iframe src="http://music.163.com/outchain/player?type=2&amp;id=1415153926&amp;auto=0&amp;height=32" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="cloudmusic" style="width: 95%; min-width: 300px; height: 52px;"></iframe></p> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">光。</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">微光。</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>起初是一丝微光，像是黑夜中的一颗孤星。可突然之间，它猛然膨胀，越来越快、越来越亮，如同宇宙诞生之初的大爆炸。转瞬之间刺眼的白色就已经填满了整个空间，她惊叫着醒来。</p> <p>眼前，一盏圆灯正对着自己，她本能地想用手去遮挡，却发现双手已经被牢牢地捆在一起。</p> <p>“姓名。”</p> <p>一个粗糙的声音说道，语气冷酷而生硬。</p> <p>她的身体开始渐渐恢复知觉，随之而来的还有一股难以忍受的疲惫与酸痛，仿佛刚刚被驱赶着跑完整个马拉松一样，四肢几乎要从躯干上松脱下来。</p> <p>“姓名。”</p> <p>她的头像是被灌满了铅，任何思考的尝试都会让大脑像被尖叉粗鲁地搅动一般剧痛。<em>“姓名？”</em>她的双臂被吊悬在天花板上，绳索磨破了皮肤，整个身体的重量撕扯着她的肩膀。</p> <p><em>姓名？我的……名字？</em></p> <p>她的脑海中忽然浮现出一件物品的样子。它们或是布质、或是木质，冰冷的金属螺钉将零件绞接在一起，拼凑出一个人形的轮廓。电光石火间，她回想起了他们的名字。</p> <p>“姓名。”那个声音不耐烦地大声吼了出来。</p> <p>“Doll。”</p> <p>她嚅动嘴唇，悄声答道。</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p><strong>插画：</strong></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;By&nbsp;breaddddd</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;By&nbsp;breaddddd</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd3/img539.jpg" alt="img539.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;By&nbsp;breaddddd</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;By&nbsp;breaddddd</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center"><img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/breaddddd100/%E5%B0%8F%E4%BA%BA2-26.png" alt="小人2-26.png" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;By&nbsp;miumeat</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;By&nbsp;miumeat</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center"><img src="http://scp-sandbox-3.wdfiles.com/local--files/miumeat/breadsekai" alt="breadsekai" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;By&nbsp;Lyrics&nbsp;Linn</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;By&nbsp;Lyrics&nbsp;Linn</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/local--files/lyricslinn-s-personnel-file/Sekai_s.jpg" alt="Sekai_s.jpg" class="image" /></div> </div> </div> </div> <p><em>在此非常感谢各位太太们的厚爱！</em></p> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:1.2em;"><strong>成就</strong></span></p> <table> <tr> <td><img src="http://expunged.xyz/scp/achievement/mastermedal.png" width="50" alt="mastermedal.png" class="image" /></td> <td><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:rgb(var(--dark-accent))"><strong>淘金者</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>拥有两篇评分 500 以上的文档</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="http://expunged.xyz/scp/achievement/startdash.png" width="50" alt="startdash.png" class="image" /></td> <td><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:rgb(var(--dark-accent))"><strong>加速！加速！</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>在无竞赛无精品的情况下发布一篇得分超过95%精品的作品</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="http://expunged.xyz/scp/achievement/canon-1.png" width="50" alt="canon-1.png" class="image" /></td> <td><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:rgb(var(--dark-accent))"><strong>集结号令</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>参与发起的设定成为原创作品数第二的设定</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td><img src="http://expunged.xyz/scp/achievement/takumi.png" width="50" alt="takumi.png" class="image" /></td> <td><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:rgb(var(--dark-accent))"><strong>免费更换路由器</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>为您提供技术支持</strong></span></td> </tr> </table> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sekai-s" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4476849&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609985791" alt="S